// Brand marks inlined from the Dudu C1 identity (svg/vettalon-mark.svg,
// svg/company-mark-mono.svg). Geometry is the vectorized master; do not edit
// the paths. Colors come from CSS: .ink -> var(--logo-ink), .accent -> the
// product accent, so the ink layer can flip to cream on dark backgrounds.

// Color mark: navy ink + teal accent (ink turns cream in dark mode).
